        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-20-discord-an-archive-of-community-3": {
      "id": "b-20-discord-an-archive-of-community-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "An archive of community and dev conversation knowledge, currently parked at "
        },
        {
          "insert": "games/melee/knowledge/sources/deprecated/discord_knowledge/",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". Corpus (archive) regime: years of hard-won understanding locked in conversation form — valuable, but the wrong shape for direct retrieval."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-20-discord-discord-stays-in-the-gra-4": {
      "id": "b-20-discord-discord-stays-in-the-gra-4",
      "type": "quote",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Discord stays in the graph as an archive source, processed on a cron schedule (daily) by an extraction pipeline that mines conversations into proposed learnings with message-level evidence refs — the same fact-based funnel as past PRs: knowledge people figured out over the years becomes evidence-backed statements of how things operate. Workers never search discord directly; they reach it only by following evidence pointers on learnings. Supersedes the migration map's 'leave' verdict for the discord member of the deprecated trio."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
